[{"id":"tab_cronus_devflow","type":"tab","label":"CronusFarm 개발환경","disabled":false,"info":"순서도 UI(SVG 아이콘) + 호스트/명령. deploy 시 병합됩니다."},{"id":"02ccfe788704ab49","type":"tab","label":"PHW3988","disabled":false,"info":"PHW3988 (Tuya WiFi pH/EC/Temp) -> LAN -> MQTT(Mosquitto) + MySQL(water_quality_log) + Dashboard"},{"id":"fd_dashboard_main","type":"flexdash dashboard","port":"80","ioOpts":"{}","path":"/flexdash","redServer":true,"saveConfig":true,"allOrigins":true,"name":"FlexDash","fd_children":",fd_tab_cronus"},{"id":"fd_tab_cronus","type":"flexdash tab","name":"CronusFarm","icon":"mdi-sprout","fd_children":",fd_grid_a,fd_grid_b","fd":"fd_dashboard_main"},{"id":"fd_grid_a","type":"flexdash container","name":"A Bed","title":"A Bed","kind":"StdGrid","fd_children":",fd_toggle_led_a1,fd_toggle_led_a2,fd_toggle_pump_a1,fd_toggle_pump_a2","tab":"fd_tab_cronus","min_cols":"1","max_cols":"6","parent":"","solid":false,"cols":"2","rows":"2"},{"id":"fd_grid_b","type":"flexdash container","name":"B Bed","title":"B Bed","kind":"StdGrid","fd_children":",fd_toggle_led_b1,fd_toggle_pump_b1,fd_toggle_pump_b2","tab":"fd_tab_cronus","min_cols":"1","max_cols":"6","parent":"","solid":false,"cols":"2","rows":"2"},{"id":"cf_grp_dev_hw","type":"ui_group","z":"tab_cronus_devflow","name":"하드웨어","tab":"ui_tab_devflow","order":1,"disp":true,"width":"12","collapse":false},{"id":"cmt_devflow_readme","type":"comment","z":"tab_cronus_devflow","name":"순서도","info":"Pi는 mqtt 플로우에서 cronusfarm/pi/wifi_ssid retain 발행. secrets.h SSID 순서 참고.","x":60,"y":60,"wires":[]},{"id":"ui_tpl_devflow_diagram","type":"ui_template","z":"tab_cronus_devflow","group":"ui_grp_devflow","name":"개발환경: 개요","order":1,"width":12,"height":6,"format":"<div class=\"cf-df\"><style>\n.cf-df{font-family:system-ui,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;color:#ececec;line-height:1.5;max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;overflow:visible}\n.cf-df *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.cf-df .t{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:1.08rem;color:#aed581;font-weight:700}\n.cf-df .sub{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:0.78rem;color:#b0bec5}\n.cf-df .s{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:0.8rem;opacity:0.92}\n.cf-df .row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:center;margin:6px 0 14px;align-items:stretch}\n.cf-df .card{flex:1;min-width:136px;max-width:210px;text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(168deg,#3d3d48,#28282e);border-radius:16px;padding:14px 10px;border:1px solid #555;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n.cf-df .ic svg{width:64px;height:64px;display:block;margin:0 auto 8px;filter:drop-shadow(0 2px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.45))}\n.cf-df .cap{font-size:0.64rem;color:#ffcc80;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px}\n.cf-df .lab{font-size:0.84rem;color:#fff;font-weight:600}\n.cf-df .hint{font-size:0.7rem;color:#b0bec5;margin-top:6px;line-height:1.35}\n.cf-df .ar{align-self:center;font-size:1.3rem;color:#78909c;padding:0 2px}\n.cf-df .host{margin-top:10px;background:#222228;border:1px solid #3f3f4a;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px 10px}\n.cf-df .host h5{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:0.86rem;color:#81c784}\n.cf-df .hg{margin-bottom:14px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #35353d}\n.cf-df .hg:last-child{border-bottom:none;margin-bottom:0;padding-bottom:0}\n.cf-df .ht{font-size:0.78rem;color:#ffcc80;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px}\n.cf-df .hb{font-family:Consolas,ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:0.71rem;color:#e6e6e6;line-height:1.55;word-break:break-all}\n.cf-df .hb a,.cf-df .det a,.cf-df .arch-full a{color:#80deea;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(128,222,234,.45)}\n.cf-df details{border:1px solid #45454f;border-radius:10px;margin:10px 0;background:#292931;padding:2px 10px}\n.cf-df summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:0.84rem;color:#aed581;font-weight:700;padding:10px 4px;list-style-position:outside}\n.cf-df .det{font-size:0.73rem;color:#cfd8dc;padding:8px 6px 12px;border-top:1px solid #3a3a44}\n.cf-df ul{margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:1.1rem}\n.cf-df li{margin:6px 0}\n.cf-df .note{margin-top:12px;border-left:4px solid #5c6bc0;padding:10px 12px;background:#2a2a32;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;font-size:0.72rem}\n.cf-df .note b{color:#fff}\n.cf-df pre{display:block;background:#16161c;color:#e6ee9c;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:0.67rem;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all;margin-top:8px;border:1px solid #333}\n.cf-df .tag{display:inline-block;font-size:0.6rem;color:#ffecb3;background:#4e342e;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;margin:2px 6px 0 0;font-weight:600}\n.cf-df code{font-size:0.88em;color:#fce4ec;background:#332833;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px}\n.cf-df .arch-full{background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #d9d9de;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0 10px;font-size:0.78rem;color:#111;line-height:1.6;text-align:left;overflow:visible;max-height:none}\n.cf-df .arch-full h6{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:0.9rem;color:#1b5e20;font-weight:800}\n.cf-df .arch-full p{margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.55}\n.cf-df .arch-full ul{margin:6px 0 10px;padding-left:1.15rem}\n.cf-df .arch-full li{margin:5px 0}\n\n.cf-df .arch-full a{color:#006064;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(0,96,100,.35)}\n.cf-df .arch-full code{color:#4a148c;background:#f3e5f5}\n</style>\n<p class=\"t\">CronusFarm 개발환경</p>\n<p class=\"sub\">누적 개발 구성 반영 · 긴 문단은 아래 회색 박스에 통째로 둠(대시보드 텍스트 위젯은 줄 수 제한으로 잘림)</p>\n<p class=\"s\">워크플로우: 저장소 편집 → merge / deploy → Pi(ida)·USB 업로드 · Git(<code>git-push-with-backup.ps1</code>)</p>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"44\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#42a5f5\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#0d47a1\" opacity=\"0.35\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"44\" width=\"52\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#64b5f6\"/></svg></div><div class=\"cap\">개발</div><div class=\"lab\">PC</div><div class=\"hint\">Thalia · Artemis · Cursor</div></div><span class=\"ar\">&#8594;</span>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#78909c\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"26\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#90a4ae\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"44\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#b0bec5\"/><circle cx=\"48\" cy=\"15\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#29b6f6\"/><circle cx=\"48\" cy=\"33\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#29b6f6\"/><circle cx=\"48\" cy=\"51\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#29b6f6\"/></svg></div><div class=\"cap\">배포</div><div class=\"lab\">Pi ida</div><div class=\"hint\">Node-RED · MQTT · SQLite 브리지</div></div><span class=\"ar\">&#8594;</span>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"ic\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><path fill=\"#81d4fa\" d=\"M46 38a11 11 0 0 0-10-8 13 13 0 0 0-24 2 10 10 0 0 0 9 17h23a8 8 0 0 0 2-11z\"/></svg></div><div class=\"cap\">현장</div><div class=\"lab\">UNO R4 메인</div><div class=\"hint\">MQTT tele/cmd · 릴레이/펌프/팬</div></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"s\">데이터 스택: SQLite(정합) &#8594; InfluxDB(시계열) &#8594; Grafana(대시·알림)</p>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"cap\">SQLite</div><div class=\"lab\">관계형</div><div class=\"hint\"><code>smartfarm.sqlite</code><br/>작물·스케줄·메타·이벤트</div></div><span class=\"ar\">&#8594;</span>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"cap\">InfluxDB</div><div class=\"lab\">시계열</div><div class=\"hint\">tele·상태·알림·AI 등 시간축<br/>bucket 권장: <code>CronusFarm</code></div></div><span class=\"ar\">&#8594;</span>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"cap\">Grafana</div><div class=\"lab\">시각화</div><div class=\"hint\">Influx Flux 패널 · 알림</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"host\"><h5>호스트 · 패널 · 문서</h5>\n<div class=\"hg\"><div class=\"ht\">네트워크</div><div class=\"hb\">LAN 192.168.0.222 · WAN ida.mango-larch.ts.net</div><div class=\"hb\">SMB \\\\ida.mango-larch.ts.net\\MyCode &#8594; /home/dooly/CronusFarm</div></div>\n<div class=\"hg\"><div class=\"ht\">2004A 패널 (RepRapDiscount)</div>\n<div class=\"hb\"><span class=\"tag\">Mega·TriGorilla 시절 문서화</span><span class=\"tag\">현운영: UNO R3 패널 MCU</span></div>\n<div class=\"hb\">R4(<code>CronusFarm.ino</code>) + R3(<code>CronusFarmPanel.ino</code>) · I2C 슬레이브 <code>0x38</code> · R4 A4/A5 &#8596; R3 A4/A5, GND 공통. UART D0/D1 직결 금지(업로드·충돌 방지).</div>\n<div class=\"hb\"><a href=\"/cronusfarm-static/mega.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mega.html</a> · <code>docs/v07_2004a_exp_wiring.md</code></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"arch-full\"><h6>구성요소 역할 / 데이터 흐름 (전문, 잘림 없음)</h6>\n<p>Arduino(센서/릴레이) &#8594; Node-RED(수집·정규화·저장·제어 API) &#8594; InfluxDB(시계열: tele / alert_events / ai_detections 등) &#8594; Grafana(시각화·알림)</p>\n<p><strong>InfluxDB</strong>: 시간축 데이터(센서·장치상태·알림·AI)를 저장한다. <strong>bucket은 CronusFarm 권장.</strong> Pi에서는 NR 환경변수(CRONUSFARM_INFLUX_*)로 토큰·ORG·bucket·최소 기록 간격을 맞춘다.</p>\n<p><strong>SQLite</strong>: 관계형(작물·스케줄·이미지·AI 메타·이벤트). Grafana에서 SQLite를 직접 조회하려면 플러그인 등 추가 구성이 필요하므로, <strong>기본 구성에서는 Node-RED가 시계열을 Influx에도 함께 넣는 방식</strong>을 권장한다(정합은 SQLite·시각화용 시계열은 Influx).</p>\n<p><strong>통신(Arduino &#8594; Node-RED)</strong>: MQTT 권장 — 저전력·retain 상태·pub/sub 확장·끊김 복구에 유리. 토픽 예: <code>cronusfarm/&lt;DEVICE_ID&gt;/tele</code>, <code>cronusfarm/&lt;DEVICE_ID&gt;/cmd</code>.</p>\n</div>\n<details><summary>상세 &mdash; 패널: TriGorilla(Mega) 검토 후 UNO R3(2004A)로 전환</summary>\n<div class=\"det\"><ul>\n<li>2004A(EXP1/EXP2)용으로 TriGorilla·Mega2560(RAMPS류) 계열 문서·배선 레퍼런스가 있었고, <a href=\"/cronusfarm-static/mega.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mega.html</a> 에 남아 있다.</li>\n<li>운영에서는 메인(UNO R4 WiFi)과 분리하여 <strong>패널 전용 UNO R3</strong>로 고정: LCD·엔코더·부저 등은 R3, 제어·MQTT·릴레이는 R4.</li>\n<li>R4&#8596;R3 연결은 <strong>I2C</strong>(프로토콜 <code>panel_i2c_protocol.h</code>). EXP 핀맵은 &ldquo;현장 검증&rdquo;과 &ldquo;EXP 관례&rdquo; 두 갈래가 있어 하얀 화면 시 RS/EN/D4~7 정합을 문서 표와 맞출 것.</li>\n<li>스케치 경로: <code>arduino/CronusFarmPanel/</code>·<code>CronusFarmPanel_R3/</code> 등 저장소 기준.</li>\n</ul></div></details>\n<details><summary>상세 &mdash; DB / Influx / Grafana 도입</summary>\n<div class=\"det\"><ul>\n<li><strong>SQLite</strong>: <code>smartfarm.sqlite</code> 및 브리지 스크립트·systemd(<code>cronusfarm-sqlite-bridge</code>)로 NR과 동기.</li>\n<li><strong>InfluxDB 2.x</strong>: tele 등 시계열 적재, NR 플로우의 Influx write 노드·환경변수 참고.</li>\n<li><strong>Grafana</strong>: <code>grafana/dashboards/*.json</code> 자산, Pi 배포 시 대시 복사·reload 스크립트 경로 있음.</li>\n</ul></div></details>\n<details><summary>상세 &mdash; 명령(merge · Pi 배포)</summary>\n<div class=\"det\"><ul>\n<li><code>python scripts/merge_nodered_deploy.py --use-split</code></li>\n<li><code>.\\scripts\\deploy-cronusfarm-pi.ps1 -PiHostLan 192.168.0.222 -ApplyNodeRed -SkipArduino</code></li>\n<li>Pi: <code>sudo systemctl restart nodered.service</code></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"note\"><b>upcode (Windows)</b><pre>cd D:\\WorkSpace\\Study\\MyCode\\Cursor\\CronusFarm\npowershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\scripts\\upcode.ps1</pre><b style=\"display:block;margin-top:10px\">Pi 빌드(R4)</b><pre>export FQBN=arduino:renesas_uno:unor4wifi\n~/CronusFarm/scripts/pi-arduino-build.sh ~/CronusFarm/arduino/CronusFarm</pre></div>\n</div></details>\n</div>","storeOutMessages":false,"fwdInMessages":false,"resendOnRefresh":true,"templateScope":"local","x":360,"y":140,"wires":[[]]},{"id":"ui_tpl_devflow_flow_devdeploy","type":"ui_template","z":"tab_cronus_devflow","group":"ui_grp_devflow","name":"개발환경: 순서도(개발→배포)","order":2,"width":12,"height":9,"format":"<style>\n/* 개발환경 텍스트 블록: 대시보드 다크 테마에서도 읽히게 */\n.cfdev-mini,.cfdev-mini *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.cfdev-mini{font-family:system-ui,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;color:#e8f0fe;line-height:1.45;font-size:13px}\n.cfdev-mini .box{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:8px}\n.cfdev-mini h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:0.95rem;color:#ffd54f;font-weight:800}\n.cfdev-mini p{margin:6px 0;color:#dde7f8}\n.cfdev-mini ul{margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:1.15rem;color:#e0e7ff}\n.cfdev-mini li{margin:4px 0}\n.cfdev-mini b,.cfdev-mini strong{color:#fff}\n.cfdev-mini code{color:#ffcc80;background:rgba(0,0,0,.28);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:0.9em}\n.cfdev-mini pre{margin:8px 0 0;padding:10px 12px;background:#121822;color:#c8e6c9;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all}\n</style><div class=\"cfdev cfdev-mini\">\n<div class=\"box\">\n  <h4>순서도 1) 개발 → 머지 → Pi 적용</h4>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>분할 수정</b>: <code>nodered/flows_cronusfarm_*.json</code> (MQTT/대시보드/개발환경) + 필요 시 <code>arduino/</code>, <code>scripts/</code>, <code>docs/</code></li>\n    <li><b>머지</b>: <code>python scripts/merge_nodered_deploy.py --use-split</code> → <code>nodered/merged-deploy.json</code></li>\n    <li><b>반영(중요)</b>: scp로 파일 복사만이 아니라, Pi에서 <code>POST /admin/flows</code>로 <b>실행 중 플로우 전체 교체</b></li>\n  </ul>\n  <pre>개발 PC\n  └─ merge\n      python scripts/merge_nodered_deploy.py --use-split\n      => nodered/merged-deploy.json\n          └─ Pi(ida) 업로드(scp)\n              └─ Node-RED 적용(핵심)\n                  pi-nodered-apply-merged.sh\n                  => POST http://127.0.0.1:1880/admin/flows\n                  => 기존 flows.json 백업 생성</pre>\n</div>\n</div>","storeOutMessages":false,"fwdInMessages":false,"resendOnRefresh":true,"templateScope":"local","x":360,"y":220,"wires":[[]]},{"id":"ui_tpl_devflow_flow_runtime","type":"ui_template","z":"tab_cronus_devflow","group":"ui_grp_devflow","name":"개발환경: 순서도(운영)","order":3,"width":12,"height":7,"format":"<style>\n/* 개발환경 텍스트 블록: 대시보드 다크 테마에서도 읽히게 */\n.cfdev-mini,.cfdev-mini *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.cfdev-mini{font-family:system-ui,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;color:#e8f0fe;line-height:1.45;font-size:13px}\n.cfdev-mini .box{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:8px}\n.cfdev-mini h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:0.95rem;color:#ffd54f;font-weight:800}\n.cfdev-mini p{margin:6px 0;color:#dde7f8}\n.cfdev-mini ul{margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:1.15rem;color:#e0e7ff}\n.cfdev-mini li{margin:4px 0}\n.cfdev-mini b,.cfdev-mini strong{color:#fff}\n.cfdev-mini code{color:#ffcc80;background:rgba(0,0,0,.28);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:0.9em}\n.cfdev-mini pre{margin:8px 0 0;padding:10px 12px;background:#121822;color:#c8e6c9;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all}\n</style><div class=\"cfdev cfdev-mini\">\n<div class=\"box\">\n  <h4>순서도 2) 운영 런타임(하드웨어)</h4>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>UNO R4 WiFi(메인)</b>: 릴레이/펌프/팬 GPIO + MQTT tele/cmd</li>\n    <li><b>UNO R3(패널)</b>: 2004A LCD/엔코더 + I2C 슬레이브(<code>0x38</code>)</li>\n    <li><b>결선</b>: R4 A4(SDA)/A5(SCL) ↔ R3 A4/A5 + GND 공통, 업로드 안정성 위해 UART(D0/D1) 직결 금지</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>R3(UNO) + BigTreeTech 2004A</b> — 저장소 정본: <a href=\"https://github.com/cronusfarm/CronusFarm/blob/main/docs/cronusfarm_hardware_pins.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">docs/cronusfarm_hardware_pins.md</a> §3</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>EXP2 물리 3·5번</b> → R3 <code>A0</code>(ENC A), <code>A1</code>(ENC B) — 다이얼.</li>\n    <li><b>EXP2 물리 2번</b>(SW) → R3 <code>D10</code> — 클릭(기본 <code>CF_ENC_CLICK_USE_PIN=10</code>).</li>\n    <li><b>EXP2 물리 6번</b> → R3 <code>D13</code> — SD CS 미사용 시 <code>OUTPUT HIGH</code>.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <pre>UNO R4 WiFi(메인 제어)  ⇄  MQTT(Mosquitto on Pi)\n      ⇄(I2C A4/A5)⇄  UNO R3(패널 2004A, I2C slave 0x38)</pre>\n</div>\n</div>","storeOutMessages":false,"fwdInMessages":false,"resendOnRefresh":true,"templateScope":"local","x":360,"y":300,"wires":[[]]},{"id":"ui_tpl_devflow_flow_data","type":"ui_template","z":"tab_cronus_devflow","group":"ui_grp_devflow","name":"개발환경: 순서도(DB/관측)","order":4,"width":12,"height":7,"format":"<style>\n/* 개발환경 텍스트 블록: 대시보드 다크 테마에서도 읽히게 */\n.cfdev-mini,.cfdev-mini *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.cfdev-mini{font-family:system-ui,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;color:#e8f0fe;line-height:1.45;font-size:13px}\n.cfdev-mini .box{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:8px}\n.cfdev-mini h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:0.95rem;color:#ffd54f;font-weight:800}\n.cfdev-mini p{margin:6px 0;color:#dde7f8}\n.cfdev-mini ul{margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:1.15rem;color:#e0e7ff}\n.cfdev-mini li{margin:4px 0}\n.cfdev-mini b,.cfdev-mini strong{color:#fff}\n.cfdev-mini code{color:#ffcc80;background:rgba(0,0,0,.28);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:0.9em}\n.cfdev-mini pre{margin:8px 0 0;padding:10px 12px;background:#121822;color:#c8e6c9;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all}\n</style><div class=\"cfdev cfdev-mini\">\n<div class=\"box\">\n  <h4>순서도 3) 데이터/관측(DB · Influx · Grafana)</h4>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>SQLite</b>: 정합(작물/스케줄/메타/이벤트·AI 메타)</li>\n    <li><b>InfluxDB 2.x</b>: 시계열(tele/상태/알림/AI) · bucket은 <b>CronusFarm</b> 권장</li>\n    <li><b>Grafana</b>: Influx(Flux) 대시보드/알림</li>\n  </ul>\n  <pre>Node-RED(허브)\n  ├─ SQLite(정합)\n  ├─ InfluxDB(시계열, bucket CronusFarm)\n  └─ Grafana(대시/알림)</pre>\n</div>\n</div>","storeOutMessages":false,"fwdInMessages":false,"resendOnRefresh":true,"templateScope":"local","x":360,"y":380,"wires":[[]]},{"id":"ui_tpl_devflow_arch_full","type":"ui_template","z":"tab_cronus_devflow","group":"ui_grp_devflow","name":"개발환경: 구성요소 역할/데이터흐름","order":5,"width":12,"height":10,"format":"<style>\n/* 개발환경 텍스트 블록: 대시보드 다크 테마에서도 읽히게 */\n.cfdev-mini,.cfdev-mini *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.cfdev-mini{font-family:system-ui,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;color:#e8f0fe;line-height:1.45;font-size:13px}\n.cfdev-mini .box{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:8px}\n.cfdev-mini h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:0.95rem;color:#ffd54f;font-weight:800}\n.cfdev-mini p{margin:6px 0;color:#dde7f8}\n.cfdev-mini ul{margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:1.15rem;color:#e0e7ff}\n.cfdev-mini li{margin:4px 0}\n.cfdev-mini b,.cfdev-mini strong{color:#fff}\n.cfdev-mini code{color:#ffcc80;background:rgba(0,0,0,.28);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:0.9em}\n.cfdev-mini pre{margin:8px 0 0;padding:10px 12px;background:#121822;color:#c8e6c9;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all}\n</style><div class=\"cfdev cfdev-mini\">\n<div class=\"box\">\n  <h4>구성요소 역할 / 데이터 흐름(요약) — 전문(잘림 없이)</h4>\n  <p>Arduino(센서/릴레이) → Node-RED(수집·정규화·저장·제어 API) → InfluxDB(시계열: tele/alert_events/ai_detections 등) → Grafana(시각화·알림)</p>\n  <p><b>InfluxDB</b>: 시간축 데이터(센서·장치상태·알림·AI)를 저장. bucket은 <b>CronusFarm</b> 권장.</p>\n  <p><b>SQLite</b>: 관계형(작물/스케줄/이미지/AI 메타/이벤트). Grafana에서 직접 조회하려면 플러그인 등 추가 구성이 필요하므로, 기본 구성에서는 Node-RED가 시계열을 Influx에도 같이 저장하는 방식 권장.</p>\n  <p><b>통신</b>(Arduino → Node-RED): MQTT 권장(topic 예: <code>cronusfarm/&lt;DEVICE_ID&gt;/tele</code>, <code>cronusfarm/&lt;DEVICE_ID&gt;/cmd</code>)</p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>패널 이력</b>: Mega+TriGorilla 레퍼런스는 문서/mega.html로 남기되, 운영은 UNO R3 패널 + I2C로 단순화(2004A 대응).</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n</div>","storeOutMessages":false,"fwdInMessages":false,"resendOnRefresh":true,"templateScope":"local","x":360,"y":460,"wires":[[]]},{"id":"cf_tpl_dev_hw_panel","type":"ui_template","z":"tab_cronus_devflow","group":"cf_grp_dev_hw","name":"패널 LCD 부팅 순서(문서 링크)","order":1,"width":0,"height":0,"format":"<div class=\"cf-dev-hw-panel\" style=\"font-family:system-ui,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;color:#ececec\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:700;color:#aed581\">패널 LCD 표시 상태</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;opacity:.92\">R3/R4 부팅 시 2004A 패널에 나오는 화면 순서(한 페이지).</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 10px\"><a href=\"/cronusfarm-static/cronusfarm_panel_lcd_boot.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#80deea\">문서 열기 (패널 부팅 순서)</a></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;opacity:.85;font-size:11px\">Pi 적용 후에도 링크가 안 열리면 <code style=\"color:#ffcc80\">bash ~/CronusFarm/scripts/pi-nodered-apply-settings-farm.sh</code> 로 settings(httpStatic)를 한 번 실행하세요.</p>\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"72\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 72\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;max-width:420px;margin:6px 0 0;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04)\">\n<rect x=\"4\" y=\"18\" width=\"88\" height=\"36\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#80cbc4\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"48\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b2dfdb\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">R4 WiFi</text>\n<path d=\"M96 36 L130 36\" stroke=\"#90caf9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/>\n<rect x=\"132\" y=\"18\" width=\"88\" height=\"36\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#90caf9\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"176\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#bbdefb\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">MQTT</text>\n<path d=\"M224 36 L258 36\" stroke=\"#ce93d8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/>\n<rect x=\"260\" y=\"18\" width=\"88\" height=\"36\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ce93d8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"304\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e1bee7\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Pi NR</text>\n<path d=\"M352 36 L386 36\" stroke=\"#ffcc80\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/>\n<rect x=\"388\" y=\"14\" width=\"28\" height=\"44\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffcc80\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"402\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffe0b2\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">LCD</text>\n<defs><marker id=\"ah\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 z\" fill=\"#90caf9\"/></marker></defs>\n<text x=\"210\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#9db0cc\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">현장 데이터 흐름(개념)</text>\n</svg>\n<p style=\"margin:12px 0 6px;font-weight:700;color:#90caf9\">R3 EXP1 / EXP2 → UNO (CronusFarm 기본)</p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;margin:0 0 10px;color:#ececec\"><thead><tr style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.08)\"><th style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">EXP1</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">UNO</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">역할</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">1</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">D9</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">부저 (반대 VCC·10)</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">2</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">D8</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">엔코더 클릭</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">3–8</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">D7→D2</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">LCD EN/RS/D4–D7</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">9</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">GND</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">오른쪽 위(확인)</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">10</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">5V</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">VCC 오른쪽 아래</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px;margin:0 0 10px;color:#ececec\"><thead><tr style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.08)\"><th style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">EXP2</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">UNO</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">역할</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">1</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">D12</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">풀업</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">2</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">D10</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">MISO/SPI (클릭 아님)</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">3 / 5</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">A0 / A1</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">ENC A / B</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">4</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">D11</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">풀업</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">6</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">D13</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #455a64;padding:3px 4px\">SD CS HIGH</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;opacity:.85;font-size:11px\">전체 표·LCD 상태 상세는 아래 <code style=\"color:#ffcc80\">cf_tpl_dev_panel_usage</code> 노드와 동일 본문 <code style=\"color:#ffcc80\">panel_usage_cf_tpl.html</code> — <code style=\"color:#ffcc80\">python scripts/sync_panel_usage_into_dashboard_shell.py</code></p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;opacity:.88;font-size:11px\">저장소 파일: <code style=\"color:#ffcc80\">nodered/dashboard/cronusfarm_panel_lcd_boot.html</code></p>\n</div>","storeOutMessages":true,"fwdInMessages":false,"resendOnRefresh":true,"templateScope":"local","x":0,"y":0,"wires":[[]]},{"id":"cf_tpl_dev_panel_usage","type":"ui_template","z":"tab_cronus_devflow","group":"cf_grp_dev_hw","name":"사용가이드 (패널 LCD·다이얼)","order":3,"width":12,"height":10,"format":"<div class=\"cf-pu-scroll\"><style>\n/* Dashboard /ui ui_template 높이 제한 시에도 스크롤로 전체 표시 */\n.cf-pu-scroll{max-height:min(92vh,4800px);overflow-y:auto;overflow-x:hidden;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;padding-right:10px;box-sizing:border-box}\n.cf-pu{font-family:system-ui,\"Malgun Gothic\",sans-serif;color:#eceff1;line-height:1.5;max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto}\n.cf-pu h3{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:1.05rem;color:#aed581;font-weight:800}\n.cf-pu h4{margin:16px 0 6px;font-size:0.92rem;color:#90caf9;font-weight:700}\n.cf-pu h5{margin:12px 0 4px;font-size:0.85rem;color:#b0bec5;font-weight:600}\n.cf-pu p,.cf-pu li{font-size:0.8rem;color:#cfd8dc;margin:5px 0}\n.cf-pu ul{margin:4px 0;padding-left:1.1rem}\n.cf-pu .snap{font-family:Consolas,\"Courier New\",monospace;font-size:0.7rem;color:#e1f5fe;background:#0a1620;padding:8px 10px;margin:6px 0;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #37474f;white-space:pre;line-height:1.32;overflow-x:auto}\n.cf-pu .cap{font-size:0.68rem;color:#78909c;margin:0 0 8px}\n.cf-pu .dial{margin-top:10px;padding:10px 12px;background:#263238;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #455a64;font-size:0.78rem}\n.cf-pu .dial strong{color:#fff7c2}\n.cf-pu code{font-size:0.82em;background:#37474f;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;color:#ffe082}\n.cf-pu table{font-size:0.72rem;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:6px 0}\n.cf-pu th,.cf-pu td{border:1px solid #455a64;padding:4px 6px;text-align:left}\n.cf-pu th{background:#37474f;color:#ffcc80}\n.cf-pu .note{border-left:3px solid #5c6bc0;padding:6px 10px;background:#2a2a32;margin:8px 0;font-size:0.74rem;color:#b0bec5}\n</style>\n<div class=\"cf-pu\">\n\n<h3>패널 LCD — 전체 상태 (20×4, 캡처 스타일)</h3>\n<h4>이 문서가 붙는 Node-RED 위치</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>개발플로우 탭</strong> <code>ui_tab_devflow</code> → 그룹 <strong>하드웨어</strong> (<code>cf_grp_dev_hw</code>) → <code>cf_tpl_dev_hw_panel</code>(EXP1/EXP2 핀 요약) · 템플릿 <code>cf_tpl_dev_panel_usage</code> (표기상 “패널 LCD 사용 가이드” 전체).</li>\n<li><strong>Dashboard 1</strong> <code>/ui</code> 의 <strong>쉘(Shell)</strong> 탭 → <code>ui_tpl_shell_panel_usage</code> 노드(이 HTML과 동일 본문). 정본 파일은 저장소 <code>nodered/panel_usage_cf_tpl.html</code> — 수정 후 <code>python scripts/sync_panel_usage_into_dashboard_shell.py</code> 로 devflow·쉘에 동기.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>R3 EXP1(2004A) ↔ UNO — 액정·부저·전원 (현장 검증)</h4>\n<p><strong>2×5 IDC:</strong> 확인 기준 <strong>오른쪽 위 = 9번(GND)</strong>, <strong>오른쪽 아래 = 10번(VCC)</strong>. <strong>엔코더 회전은 EXP2</strong> 리본, <strong>클릭은 EXP1-2 → D8</strong>(EXP1-2와 EXP2-2를 **잇지 않아도 됨**). EXP1-1은 <strong>부저</strong>, 타단 <strong>VCC</strong>(통상 10번).</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>EXP1 물리</th><th>역할</th><th>UNO(R3) 연결</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>1</td><td><strong>부저</strong> (타단 VCC·보통 10번)</td><td><strong>D9</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>2</td><td><strong>엔코더 클릭</strong> (BTN_ENC)</td><td><strong>D8</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>3</td><td>LCD EN</td><td><strong>D7</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>4</td><td>LCD RS</td><td><strong>D6</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>5</td><td>LCD D4</td><td><strong>D5</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>6</td><td>LCD D5</td><td><strong>D4</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>7</td><td>LCD D6</td><td><strong>D3</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>8</td><td>LCD D7</td><td><strong>D2</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>9</td><td>GND</td><td><strong>GND</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td>10</td><td>5V (VCC)</td><td><strong>5V</strong></td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>정본: <a href=\"https://github.com/cronusfarm/CronusFarm/blob/main/docs/cronusfarm_hardware_pins.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">docs/cronusfarm_hardware_pins.md</a> §3.2.1.</p>\n\n<h4>R3 EXP2(2004A) ↔ UNO — 엔코더·SD (교차 배선)</h4>\n<p><strong>엔코더 회전(A/B)·SD SPI</strong>는 EXP2. 기본(교차): <strong>2→D10</strong>(MISO 등·클릭 아님), <strong>3·5→A0·A1</strong>, <strong>6→D13</strong>. 클릭은 <strong>EXP1-2→D8</strong>.</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>EXP2 물리</th><th>UNO 핀(연결)</th><th>역할(기본 펌웨어)</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>1</td><td>D12</td><td>풀업 고정</td></tr>\n<tr><td>2</td><td><strong>D10</strong></td><td>SPI/MISO 등 (클릭은 EXP1-2→D8)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>3</td><td>A0</td><td>ENC A</td></tr>\n<tr><td>4</td><td>D11</td><td>풀업 고정</td></tr>\n<tr><td>5</td><td>A1</td><td>ENC B</td></tr>\n<tr><td>6</td><td><strong>D13</strong></td><td>SD CS <code>OUTPUT HIGH</code></td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>정본 <code>docs/cronusfarm_hardware_pins.md</code> §5·§5.6. 테두리 <code>|</code> 안은 <strong>정확히 20글자</strong>. R4 대기 2행은 <code>snprintf(\"%s %s\", \"WiFi …\", \" MQTT …\")</code> 때문에 <strong>WiFi 끝과 MQTT 사이에 공백 두 칸</strong>이 들어간다.</p>\n\n<h4>A. R3만 (I2C 마스터 없음)</h4>\n<h5>A-1 부팅 직후</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|CronusFarm Panel    |\n|                    |\n|                    |\n|                    |\n+--------------------+</div>\n<h5>A-2 약 10초 후 로컬 환영 (<code>BOOT_MSG_MS</code>)</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|Welcome to CronusFar|\n|----.--.-- (---)    |\n|--:--:--            |\n|                    |\n+--------------------+</div>\n<span class=\"cap\">1행 21자 소스 → 20자만 표시. 2·3행은 플레이스홀더(R3 RTC 미갱신).</span>\n\n<h4>B. R4 스플래시 (I2C 링크 직후, 각 <strong>최소 5초</strong>)</h4>\n<h5>B-1 WiFi OK / MQTT OK</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|CronusFarm          |\n|WiFi OK             |\n|MQTT OK             |\n|Dial/Push Ready     |\n+--------------------+</div>\n<h5>B-2 WiFi OK / MQTT --</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|CronusFarm          |\n|WiFi OK             |\n|MQTT --             |\n|Dial/Push Ready     |\n+--------------------+</div>\n<p class=\"cap\"><strong>B-3(구·이론)</strong> WiFi <code>--</code> + MQTT <code>OK</code> 조합은 WiFi 경로만 쓰면 나오지 않는 것이 맞다. <strong>현재 펌웨어</strong>는 표시상 WiFi 끊기면 MQTT 줄도 무조건 <code>MQTT --</code> 로 맞춘다.</p>\n<h5>B-3 WiFi -- / MQTT --</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|CronusFarm          |\n|WiFi --             |\n|MQTT --             |\n|Dial/Push Ready     |\n+--------------------+</div>\n\n<h4>C. R4 WiFi 대기 (<code>lcdRenderUi</code>, 환영 전, <strong>최소 5초</strong> 타이머 구간)</h4>\n<p>1행: 채널·핀(기본 <code>LED A1 D2</code>). 2행: WiFi 미연결 시 MQTT 표시도 <code>--</code> 로 통일 → 실질적으로 <strong>3종</strong>(WiFi 끔 / WiFi 켬·MQTT 끔 / 둘 다 켬).</p>\n<h5>C-1 WiFi 미연결</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|LED A1 D2           |\n|WiFi --  MQTT --    |\n|Waiting link...     |\n|                    |\n+--------------------+</div>\n<h5>C-2 WiFi 연결·MQTT 미연결</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|LED A1 D2           |\n|WiFi OK  MQTT --    |\n|Waiting link...     |\n|                    |\n+--------------------+</div>\n<h5>C-3 WiFi·MQTT 연결 (환영 전이면 잠깐만 보일 수 있음)</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|LED A1 D2           |\n|WiFi OK  MQTT OK    |\n|Waiting link...     |\n|                    |\n+--------------------+</div>\n\n<h4>D. R4 환영 (<code>lcdWelcomeIfOk</code>, <strong>최대 약 5초</strong>)</h4>\n<h5>D-1 RTC 정상 (예시)</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|Welcome to          |\n|CronusFarm          |\n|2026.05.12 (Mon)    |\n|12:34:56 PM         |\n+--------------------+</div>\n<h5>D-2 RTC 읽기 실패</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|Welcome to          |\n|CronusFarm          |\n|RTC -- set time     |\n|--:--:--            |\n+--------------------+</div>\n<h5>D-3 RTC 칩만 이상·무효일 때 부트 1회 기본값 (<code>rtcEnsureValidOnce</code>)</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|Welcome to          |\n|CronusFarm          |\n|2025.12.22 (Mon)    |\n|09:00:00 AM         |\n+--------------------+</div>\n<span class=\"cap\">연·월·일 요일은 펌웨어 고정(2025-12-22). 이후 NTP·수동으로 교정. 칩에 이미 유효 연도가 있으면 이 블록은 적용 안 됨.</span>\n\n<h4>FAQ — R4 켜 둔 채 R3만 리셋</h4>\n<p>R4는 패널 살아 있다고 착각할 수 있어 I2C가 <strong>1.5초 이상</strong> 응답 없으면 링크 해제 후 다시 스플래시·동기한다. 스플래시는 <strong>이미 환영된 세션</strong>에서도 <code>lcdBrowseDraw</code>가 덮지 않도록 유지 시간을 존중한다. 다이얼 돌릴 때 빈 줄은 I2C에서 <strong>4행 매번 전송</strong>으로 완화.</p>\n\n<h4>E. 브라우즈 (<code>lcdBrowseDraw</code>, 환영 5초 후 또는 다이얼로 생략)</h4>\n<p>2행: <code>MODE:AUTO</code> 또는 <code>MODE:MAN </code>(끝 공백). 3행: <code>STATE:ON </code> 또는 <code>STATE:OFF</code> + 고정 공백 + <code>CH순번/15</code>.</p>\n<h5>E-1 CH1 LED A1 · MAN · OFF</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|LED A1 (D2)         |\n|MODE:MAN            |\n|STATE:OFF    CH1/15 |\n|Dial:Next, Push:Edit|\n+--------------------+</div>\n<h5>E-2 CH1 · AUTO · ON</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|LED A1 (D2)         |\n|MODE:AUTO           |\n|STATE:ON     CH1/15 |\n|Dial:Next, Push:Edit|\n+--------------------+</div>\n<h5>E-3 CH8 FAN A1 · MAN · OFF</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|FAN A1 (D9)         |\n|MODE:MAN            |\n|STATE:OFF    CH8/15 |\n|Dial:Next, Push:Edit|\n+--------------------+</div>\n<h5>E-4 CH15 PUMP D2 · MAN · OFF</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|PUMP D2 (A3)        |\n|MODE:MAN            |\n|STATE:OFF    CH15/15|\n|Dial:Next, Push:Edit|\n+--------------------+</div>\n<h5>E-5 이상: 2행만 비어 보임 (현장)</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|LED A1 (D2)         |\n|                    |\n|STATE:OFF    CH1/15 |\n|Dial:Next, Push:Edit|\n+--------------------+</div>\n<span class=\"cap\">정상 코드는 2행에 항상 MODE를 보냄. I2C 실패·캐시·대비·잔상 → §5.4. 최신 펌웨어는 전송 실패 시 캐시 미갱신.</span>\n\n<h5>E-6 브라우즈 1행 — 채널 15개 (괄호·핀, 펌웨어 그대로)</h5>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>순번</th><th>1행 내용 (20열로 패딩됨)</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>1</td><td><code>LED A1 (D2)         </code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>2</td><td><code>LED A2 (D3)         </code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>3</td><td><code>LED B1 (D6)         </code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>4</td><td><code>PUMP A1 (D4)        </code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>5</td><td><code>PUMP A2 (D5)        </code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>6</td><td><code>PUMP B1 (D7)        </code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>7</td><td><code>PUMP B2 (D8)        </code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>8</td><td><code>FAN A1 (D9)         </code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>9</td><td><code>FAN A2 (D10)        </code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>10</td><td><code>FAN B1 (D11)        </code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>11</td><td><code>FAN B2 (D12)        </code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>12</td><td><code>PUMP C1 (A0)        </code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>13</td><td><code>PUMP C2 (A1)        </code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>14</td><td><code>PUMP D1 (A2)        </code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>15</td><td><code>PUMP D2 (A3)        </code></td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h4>F. EDIT (<code>lcdRenderUi</code> EDIT 분기)</h4>\n<h5>F-1 SET:OFF (CH1 예)</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|Setting Mode (EDIT) |\n|LED A1 (D2)         |\n|SET:OFF             |\n|Dial:Sel Push:OK    |\n+--------------------+</div>\n<h5>F-2 SET:ON</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|Setting Mode (EDIT) |\n|LED A1 (D2)         |\n|SET:ON              |\n|Dial:Sel Push:OK    |\n+--------------------+</div>\n<h5>F-3 SET:AUTO</h5>\n<div class=\"snap\">+--------------------+\n|Setting Mode (EDIT) |\n|LED A1 (D2)         |\n|SET:AUTO            |\n|Dial:Sel Push:OK    |\n+--------------------+</div>\n<span class=\"cap\">2행(장치명)은 E-6과 동일. 다이얼은 <strong>OFF→ON→AUTO</strong> 순환. AUTO=<code>chAuto</code>(펌웨어 펌프 주기·Pi MQTT <code>auto_*</code>·스케줄 연동).</span>\n\n<h4>G. 다이얼</h4>\n<div class=\"dial\">\n<strong>브라우즈</strong> — 회전: 채널 이전/다음(표 E-6 순서). 누름: EDIT. 환영 5초 안 첫 입력은 CH1부터.<br/>\n<strong>EDIT</strong> — 회전: <strong>OFF / ON / AUTO</strong> 순환. 누름: 적용 후 브라우즈.\n</div>\n\n<h4>Node-RED / 동기</h4>\n<p>노드 부착 위치는 위 §「이 문서가 붙는 Node-RED 위치」. Dashboard 2: <code>/nrdb2</code>. 배포 머지는 <code>merge_nodered_deploy.py --use-split</code> 등 <code>docs/cronusfarm_hardware_pins.md</code> §4.</p>\n\n<div class=\"note\">R3가 <code>PANEL_CMD_CLEAR</code> 직후 잠깐 빈 화면이 나올 수 있음(즉시 다음 <code>SET_LINE</code>으로 채워짐).</div>\n</div>\n</div>","storeOutMessages":false,"fwdInMessages":false,"resendOnRefresh":true,"templateScope":"local","x":360,"y":140,"wires":[[]]},{"id":"ui_tpl_devflow_entity","type":"ui_template","z":"tab_cronus_devflow","group":"ui_grp_devflow_entity","name":"정체 요약 패널","order":1,"width":12,"height":1,"format":"<div class=\"cf-ent\"><style>\n.cf-ent{font-family:system-ui,'Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;color:#e8f0fe;line-height:1.45;font-size:13px;max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto}\n.cf-ent *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.cf-ent h4{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:0.95rem;color:#aed581;font-weight:800}\n.cf-ent .box{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:10px}\n.cf-ent table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size